{"id":879838,"title":"17｜部署Dify","content":"安装开源项目Dify首先需要从GitHub克隆其官方仓库。进入docker目录后，通过复制并编辑.env文件来配置适合幕僚云平台的端口映射，如将NGINX端口设为8890以适应平台限制。接着使用docker compose up -d命令启动Dify服务，但由于国内服务器拉取镜像可能遇到问题，需修改Docker守护进程配置文件daemon.json以指向国内镜像源，并重启Docker服务确保更改生效。完成上述步骤后，所有微服务成功运行，此时可通过浏览器访问公网IP加指定端口的方式打开Dify界面，输入注册信息登录即可开始使用，包括聊天助手、Agent等功能与云上版本一致。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401043,"user_name":"峻萧Peyton","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3883792,"ip_address":"河北","ucode":"FCAC0C786F49C9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3b/43/10/1c2731df.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1750488436,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145917,"content":"课程配套资料：\nhttps:&#47;&#47;jcn7i8etm68y.feishu.cn&#47;wiki&#47;Czcnwew2uiM2VrkMSCLcu3nenUb 密码：918V795#","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1751853936,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":401043,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"配置好的源可以发到评论区吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668209,"discussion_content":"课程配套资料：\nhttps://jcn7i8etm68y.feishu.cn/wiki/Czcnwew2uiM2VrkMSCLcu3nenUb 密码：918V795#","content_length":83,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1751853936,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":402398,"user_name":"怀揣梦想的学渣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1916685,"ip_address":"山东","ucode":"2349B9F4F6FDE3","user_